<title>USA: Merrill Lynch downgrades Coles Myer.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch downgrades Coles Myer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it downgraded Australian retailer Coles Myer Ltd to near-term neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>The brokerage firm said it kept the long-term rating as accumulate.</p>
<p>Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
